{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301212","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301212","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1430121201:1":{"text":"제가 제일 잘하는 생선구이로 푸카린을 설득하려고요. 제자로 받아달라고요!","source_cn":"因为我打算用我最拿手的烤鱼来说服芙卡铃，让她收我为徒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28590545A2A98E9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430121202:1":{"text":"카르그, 낚시하는 법은 언제든지 가르쳐 준다니까? 아무리 그래도 제자로 받는 건 아니지...","source_cn":"卡尔格，我说过你可以随时找我交流钓鱼心得的。至于拜师还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55A0AF7B3CF24275","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430121203:1":{"text":"스승님, 우선 제 생선구이부터 한번 드셔보시고 그다음에 결정하셔도 늦지 않아요!","source_cn":"师傅，请尝尝我的烤鱼手艺！尝完后再决定！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E0A4C9100D4C595","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人卡尔格":{"text":"드워프 카르그","source":"矮人卡尔格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:工匠芙卡铃":{"text":"장인 푸카린","source":"工匠芙卡铃","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}